"""Demo dataset.

The app must be *runnable and demoable* with `docker compose up` and nothing
else — no Postgres dump, no API keys, no 40-minute ingest. This module carries a
league-wide baseline (30 teams, ~90 players, real NBA ids so the official CDN
headshots and logos resolve) which `scripts/export_seed.py` dumps to JSON for
the frontend.

Baselines only. Game logs, season splits and head-to-head history are *derived*
from these with a seeded generator (`app.services.synth`), which keeps the
payload small and every chart populated.

Replace this the moment `scripts/ingest.py` has run: the services read the DB
first and fall back here only when a table is empty.
"""
